-- Two `@lang` lines that name different languages. The last one wins, so this
-- module is Hebrew and the `@lang en` line has no effect; the diagnostic says so,
-- naming both languages and the line that is used.
@lang en
@lang he

GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is large` @nlg the amount is large
  IF amount GREATER THAN 100
